    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100198" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπείγω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help to urge on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ κάκιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸν κίνδυνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					1.4
				</span></i>
			: abs., ib.<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>, etc.: intr., <i>hasten on</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.2
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, in same sense, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπείγεσθαί τινι</span>
			<i>increase</i> or <i>grow with</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				14.23
			</span></i>.</div>
